msgstr "Namco NA-JV JVS board (COM3), Namco motor board (COM1)."

#: src/launcher/gamelist.cpp:86 src/launcher/gamelist.cpp:88 src/launcher/gamelist.cpp:90 src/launcher/gamelist.cpp:92
